  "done": "Done. Your RUSTIC twin over twin bunk bed is built. Give it a proud little pat.",
  "notes": "Brand page: assembled 78.5\" L × 43.5\" W × 63.25\" H, solid wood slats and a metal support bar, mattresses up to 8\". Brand Q&A: lower bunk about 10\" off the floor, about 14\" of top-bunk depth. Rail and ladder layout are our best guess from the photos."
